Conflicts: amule, amule-common, amule-daemon, amule-utils, amule-utils-gui
Description: weekly development snapshot of the aMule client and daemon
 aMule is a client for the eD2k and Kademlia networks.
 This package includes the desktop client, remote GUI, headless daemon,
 command line client, ed2k link handler and REST API with its web interface.
 It replaces the distribution's aMule packages while installed.
